{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おつかれさまです♡.＊\nまにだよ？  ろってぃ−だよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の『乃木坂工事中』に出演してました．\n1番手前に座ってたんだけど分かったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう，れなさんに「まひろちゃんは、都営浅草線っぽい！」と言って頂きましたU・x・U笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなさんのラストの収録に参加できて良かったです.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなさんにはグループ全体のこと，個人的にも色々なことを教えて頂きました。\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーーーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして・・・。\n時間があればいつもせっちゃんと居るのですが♡..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近，表参道にあるハワイで人気のお店に行ってきました.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃじゃぁ～んヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/05/18/2910121/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑ポーズいい感じ♡笑\n超とろぉ～りとしたチーズがかかってます．\n女子は釘付けだね♡？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃん美人！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/05/18/2910121/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして！ ご飯物も♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/05/18/2910121/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しそうでしょ～（＾ω＾）？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぉぉ。お気に入り♡笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/05/18/2910121/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう夏くるね♡\nまひろの時代がやって来た。。。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/05/18/2910121/0004.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}